						<description>"My family, my clan, my team - they all tried to keep a shroud over my eyes to stop me from seeing a simple fact: Each person is unique and valuable and must walk his or her own path. But that was only my path - What will yours be?"

  - &lt;i&gt;Reflections by a Water Gatherer&lt;/i&gt; by Merlin Coffey</description>
