						<name>Strong Archaeo-Sinduism</name>
						<adjective>Archaeo-Sindu</adjective>
						<memberName>Archaeo-Sindu</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>First Marshal</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>First Marshal</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The first settlers that arrived at the oceanic planet Wavia paved over the natural world and killed the animals. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Gayatri&lt;/color&gt; wiped them out to punish them for their disrespect towards his creations. A whaler admiral passed a law forbidding Archaeo-Sindus from rising to the ruling classes of Wavia. A sail maker named Bud 'Pepper' Allen freed many animals that were enslaved by cruel masters, and took them to sanctuary in the shrine of &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Gayatri&lt;/color&gt;. Pepper destroyed the capital of Wavia with a high-yield torpedo, killing the whaler admiral. He took his place as ruler of Wavia - and the universe beyond.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>The first settlers that arrived at the oceanic planet Wavia paved over the natural world and killed the animals. %%Deity0_name%% wiped them out to punish them for their disrespect towards %%deity0_possessive%% creations. A whaler admiral passed a law forbidding %%memberNamePlural%% from rising to the ruling classes of Wavia. A sail maker named Bud 'Pepper' Allen freed many animals that were enslaved by cruel masters, and took them to sanctuary in the %%altarRoomLabel%% of %%deity0_name%%. Pepper destroyed the capital of Wavia with a high-yield torpedo, killing the whaler admiral. He took his place as ruler of Wavia - and the universe beyond.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Rustican</culture>
						<iconDef>ElementE</iconDef>
						<colorDef>LightRed</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.477, 0.698, 0.985, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
