						<name>Fundamental Spiritism</name>
						<adjective>spiritual</adjective>
						<memberName>Spiritist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Divine Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Divine Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The people of the oceanic planet Wavia lived under the loyal supervision of &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Cangalbrin&lt;/color&gt;. The whaler admiral could not abide the family of Spiritists, and sent his whaler-marines to the trading atoll to divide them against each other. The prophet Baboon Tona was miraculously born from a tree in Wavia, and discovered by his parents in the boughs of an old walnut tree. With the strength of &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Cangalbrin&lt;/color&gt;, Baboon and the Spiritists could not be divided. They defeated the whaler-marines with assault rifles and banished the whaler admiral from Wavia.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>The people of the oceanic planet Wavia lived under the loyal supervision of %%deity0_name%%. The whaler admiral could not abide the family of %%memberNamePlural%%, and sent his whaler-marines to the trading atoll to divide them against each other. The prophet Baboon Tona was miraculously born from a tree in Wavia, and discovered by his parents in the boughs of an old walnut tree. With the strength of %%deity0_name%%, Baboon and the %%memberNamePlural%% could not be divided. They defeated the whaler-marines with assault rifles and banished the whaler admiral from Wavia.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Corunan</culture>
