						<leaderTitleMale>First Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>First Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;God&lt;/color&gt; burned in the depths of space and time for an eternity, and her screams brought forth our reality. The faithful fought the unbelievers, and &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;God&lt;/color&gt; said, "Fight them, everywhere, in my name, until I am worshipped throughout the universe and the true peace may finally reign." The Creator of All &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;God&lt;/color&gt; ate the bodies of her enemies.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>%%Deity0_name%% burned in the depths of space and time for an eternity, and %%deity0_possessive%% screams brought forth our reality. The faithful fought the unbelievers, and %%deity0_name%% said, "Fight them, everywhere, in my name, until I am worshipped throughout the universe and the true peace may finally reign." The %%deity0_type%% %%deity0_name%% ate the bodies of %%deity0_possessive%% enemies.</descriptionTemplate>
