						<name>Great Kleptism</name>
						<adjective>kleptic</adjective>
						<memberName>Kleptor</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Ethical Gun</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Ethical Gun</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Persecuted and imprisoned, Takuya Hart boiled with rage. He escaped, formed his gang, and returned to ruin the weak who had taken so much from him. Hart instructed all outsiders to submit. When the first city refused, he used a stampeding herd of novoraptors to kill everyone inside. One day while walking the streets, Hart was surrounded by filthy beggars. He beat them down, taking the money from the weak and worthless that it might be put to good use.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Persecuted and imprisoned, Takuya Hart boiled with rage. He escaped, formed his gang, and returned to ruin the weak who had taken so much from him. Hart instructed all outsiders to submit. When the first city refused, he used a stampeding herd of novoraptors to kill everyone inside. One day while walking the streets, Hart was surrounded by filthy beggars. He beat them down, taking the money from the weak and worthless that it might be put to good use.</descriptionTemplate>
