					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Iwamura</place>
							<deities />
						</foundation>
						<name>Path of Animism</name>
						<adjective>animist</adjective>
						<memberName>Animist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Spirit Speaker</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Spirit Speaker</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>A parallel universe of spirits lies next to our own. A seemingly inanimate object in this universe corresponds to an animated spirit in the other. Spirits become restless when humanity attempts to change them from their true nature. Our book says that the spirit of the great &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Ani- Launcher&lt;/color&gt; will one day grant its wielder power over all spirits.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>A parallel universe of spirits lies next to our own. A seemingly inanimate object in this universe corresponds to an animated spirit in the other. Spirits become restless when humanity attempts to change them from their true nature. Our book says that the spirit of the great %%relic0_name%% will one day grant its wielder power over all spirits.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Astropolitan</culture>
						<iconDef>RoundE</iconDef>
						<colorDef>Mauve</colorDef>
						<memes>
